{
  "$comment": [
    "Two views over the same letter set. Neither duplicates content: both are",
    "arrays of ids from letters.json, so adding a letter means touching",
    "letters.json plus one entry in each ordering.",
    "",
    "alphabetical: standard qaida order, matching what a child is taught at",
    "school and what every Urdu primer prints.",
    "",
    "shape-families: letters that share a skeleton introduced together, so the",
    "only thing that changes within a group is the dots. This front-loads the",
    "distinction Urdu learners actually get wrong, and lets the dots themselves",
    "become the game mechanic."
  ],
